^https://httpbin\.org(?::443)?/anything/kelee-qx-url-target-result\?kelee_qx_probe=same-origin&id=qx953-v2-same$ url script-response-body https://raw.githubusercontent.com/op69qs/script-tools/main/QX/probes/url-target-response-v2.js
